@startuml
!theme plain

title Auth Endpoint Sequence - POST /api/v1/auth/register

autonumber

actor Client
participant AuthController
participant AuthService
participant UserService
database UserRepository
participant OtpService
database Redis
participant EmailService

Client -> AuthController: POST /api/v1/auth/register\nUserCreationRequest
AuthController -> AuthService: register(request)
AuthService -> UserService: createUser(request)
UserService -> UserRepository: save(user)
UserRepository --> UserService: user persisted
UserService --> AuthService: UserCreationResponse

AuthService -> OtpService: generateToStoreAndSendEmail(email)
OtpService -> Redis: save otp hash + ttl
OtpService -> EmailService: sendOtpEmail(email, otpCode)
EmailService --> OtpService: sent
OtpService --> AuthService: done

AuthService --> AuthController: UserCreationResponse
AuthController --> Client: 201 Created\nApiResponse<UserCreationResponse>

@enduml
